# ♟️ Ivory Chess

**An immersive 3D chess game built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.**

Ivory Chess brings the classic game of chess to life with a three-dimensional visual experience and an interactive chessboard.

## ✨ Features

- 3D chessboard design
- Interactive chess pieces
- Classic chess-inspired visual experience
- Responsive and user-friendly interface

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 🚀 Getting Started

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

For the best experience, follow any additional setup instructions required by the project.

## 🎮 How to Play

1. Open the game in your browser.
2. Interact with the chessboard using the controls provided in the game.
3. Enjoy the 3D chess experience.

